{"seq":4,"slug":"dsl-design","title":"DSL 设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/functional-patterns/dsl-design","wordCount":659,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"dsl-设计\">DSL 设计</h1><p>Kotlin 的语言特性——带接收者的 lambda、扩展函数、中缀表达式——使其成为构建类型安全 DSL（Domain-Specific Language）的理想语言。从 Gradle 构建脚本到 HTML 构建器，DSL 让代码具有领域语言般的可读性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>DSL 设计的核心机制是<strong>带接收者的 lambda</strong>：lambda 体内的 <code>this</code> 被替换为指定接收者，于是可以直接调用其方法、访问其属性，代码因而读起来像一段领域语言。扩展函数、中缀调用与 <code>@DslMarker</code> 只是在这之上补齐可发现性与作用域隔离，让构建器既类型安全又不会误触外层接收者。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"lambda-with-receiver\">Lambda with Receiver</h2><p>带接收者的 Lambda 是 DSL 设计的核心机制。在 lambda 内部，可以直接调用接收者对象的方法和属性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"fun buildString(action: StringBuilder.() -&gt; Unit): String {&#10;    val sb = StringBuilder()&#10;    sb.action() // action 的接收者是 sb&#10;    return sb.toString()&#10;}&#10;&#10;val result = buildString {&#10;    append(&quot;Hello&quot;)&#10;    append(&quot;, &quot;)&#10;    append(&quot;Kotlin DSL!&quot;)&#10;}&#10;println(result) // Hello, Kotlin DSL!\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fun buildString(action: StringBuilder.() -> Unit): String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val sb = StringBuilder()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sb.action() // action 的接收者是 sb</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return sb.toString()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val result = buildString {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    append(\"Hello\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    append(\", \")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    append(\"Kotlin DSL!\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>println(result) // Hello, Kotlin DSL!</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;Lambda with Receiver&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;lambda 内部 this = 接收者对象&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;直接调用接收者方法&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;无需对象前缀&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"Lambda with Receiver\"] --&gt; B[\"lambda 内部 this = 接收者对象\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"直接调用接收者方法\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"无需对象前缀\"]</pre><p>普通 lambda 与接收者 lambda 的对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>语法</th>\n<th>lambda 内部</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>普通 lambda</td>\n<td><code>(T) -&gt; R</code></td>\n<td>通过 <code>it</code> 访问</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>接收者 lambda</td>\n<td><code>T.() -&gt; R</code></td>\n<td>通过 <code>this</code> 访问（可省略）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"构建简单-dsl\">构建简单 DSL</h2><h3 id=\"html-构建器\">HTML 构建器</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class HTML {&#10;    private val children = mutableListOf&lt;String&gt;()&#10;&#10;    fun head(block: Head.() -&gt; Unit) {&#10;        val head = Head().apply(block)&#10;        children.add(head.render())&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fun body(block: Body.() -&gt; Unit) {&#10;        val body = Body().apply(block)&#10;        children.add(body.render())&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fun render(): String = &quot;&lt;html&gt;\\n${children.joinToString(&quot;\\n&quot;)}\\n&lt;/html&gt;&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;class Head {&#10;    var title: String = &quot;&quot;&#10;    fun render(): String = &quot;  &lt;head&gt;&lt;title&gt;$title&lt;/title&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;class Body {&#10;    private val elements = mutableListOf&lt;String&gt;()&#10;&#10;    fun h1(text: String) { elements.add(&quot;    &lt;h1&gt;$text&lt;/h1&gt;&quot;) }&#10;    fun p(text: String) { elements.add(&quot;    &lt;p&gt;$text&lt;/p&gt;&quot;) }&#10;&#10;    fun render(): String = &quot;  &lt;body&gt;\\n${elements.joinToString(&quot;\\n&quot;)}\\n  &lt;/body&gt;&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;fun html(block: HTML.() -&gt; Unit): String = HTML().apply(block).render()&#10;&#10;val page = html {&#10;    head {&#10;        title = &quot;Kotlin DSL&quot;&#10;    }&#10;    body {&#10;        h1(&quot;欢迎&quot;)&#10;        p(&quot;这是用 Kotlin DSL 构建的页面&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class HTML {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val children = mutableListOf&#x3C;String>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun head(block: Head.() -> Unit) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val head = Head().apply(block)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        children.add(head.render())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun body(block: Body.() -> Unit) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val body = Body().apply(block)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        children.add(body.render())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun render(): String = \"&#x3C;html>\\n${children.joinToString(\"\\n\")}\\n&#x3C;/html>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class Head {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var title: String = \"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun render(): String = \"  &#x3C;head>&#x3C;title>$title&#x3C;/title>&#x3C;/head>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class Body {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val elements = mutableListOf&#x3C;String>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun h1(text: String) { elements.add(\"    &#x3C;h1>$text&#x3C;/h1>\") }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun p(text: String) { elements.add(\"    &#x3C;p>$text&#x3C;/p>\") }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun render(): String = \"  &#x3C;body>\\n${elements.joinToString(\"\\n\")}\\n  &#x3C;/body>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun html(block: HTML.() -> Unit): String = HTML().apply(block).render()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val page = html {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    head {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        title = \"Kotlin DSL\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    body {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        h1(\"欢迎\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        p(\"这是用 Kotlin DSL 构建的页面\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"dslmarker\">@DslMarker</h2><p>当 DSL 嵌套层级较深时，内层 lambda 可以意外访问外层接收者的方法。<code>@DslMarker</code> 注解限制了这种隐式访问：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@DslMarker&#10;annotation class HtmlDsl&#10;&#10;@HtmlDsl&#10;class Table {&#10;    fun tr(block: TableRow.() -&gt; Unit) { /* ... */ }&#10;}&#10;&#10;@HtmlDsl&#10;class TableRow {&#10;    fun td(text: String) { /* ... */ }&#10;}&#10;&#10;Table().apply {&#10;    tr {&#10;        td(&quot;单元格&quot;)&#10;        // tr { }  // 编译错误！@DslMarker 阻止访问外层 Table 的 tr()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@DslMarker</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>annotation class HtmlDsl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@HtmlDsl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class Table {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun tr(block: TableRow.() -> Unit) { /* ... */ }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@HtmlDsl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class TableRow {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun td(text: String) { /* ... */ }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Table().apply {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    tr {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        td(\"单元格\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // tr { }  // 编译错误！@DslMarker 阻止访问外层 Table 的 tr()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;无 @DslMarker&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;内层可访问所有外层接收者&quot;]&#10;    C[&quot;有 @DslMarker&quot;] --&gt; D[&quot;内层只能访问最近的接收者&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;防止意外调用外层方法&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F[&quot;编译时报错&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"无 @DslMarker\"] --&gt; B[\"内层可访问所有外层接收者\"]\n    C[\"有 @DslMarker\"] --&gt; D[\"内层只能访问最近的接收者\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"防止意外调用外层方法\"]\n    D --&gt; F[\"编译时报错\"]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>@DslMarker</code> 是构建健壮 DSL 的必备工具，标注后所有被标注类型的隐式接收者在嵌套 lambda 中互斥。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"builder-pattern-类型安全构建器\">Builder Pattern（类型安全构建器）</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@DslMarker&#10;annotation class ConfigDsl&#10;&#10;@ConfigDsl&#10;class ServerConfig {&#10;    var host: String = &quot;localhost&quot;&#10;    var port: Int = 8080&#10;    private var _database: DatabaseConfig? = null&#10;    private var _logging: LoggingConfig? = null&#10;&#10;    fun database(block: DatabaseConfig.() -&gt; Unit) {&#10;        _database = DatabaseConfig().apply(block)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fun logging(block: LoggingConfig.() -&gt; Unit) {&#10;        _logging = LoggingConfig().apply(block)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fun build(): String = &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        Server: $host:$port&#10;        Database: ${_database?.url ?: &quot;未配置&quot;}&#10;        Logging: ${_logging?.level ?: &quot;INFO&quot;}&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;.trimIndent()&#10;}&#10;&#10;@ConfigDsl&#10;class DatabaseConfig {&#10;    var url: String = &quot;&quot;&#10;    var maxConnections: Int = 10&#10;}&#10;&#10;@ConfigDsl&#10;class LoggingConfig {&#10;    var level: String = &quot;INFO&quot;&#10;    var file: String = &quot;app.log&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;fun server(block: ServerConfig.() -&gt; Unit): String {&#10;    return ServerConfig().apply(block).build()&#10;}&#10;&#10;val config = server {&#10;    host = &quot;0.0.0.0&quot;&#10;    port = 443&#10;&#10;    database {&#10;        url = &quot;jdbc:postgresql://localhost:5432/mydb&quot;&#10;        maxConnections = 20&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    logging {&#10;        level = &quot;DEBUG&quot;&#10;        file = &quot;/var/log/server.log&quot;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@DslMarker</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>annotation class ConfigDsl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@ConfigDsl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class ServerConfig {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var host: String = \"localhost\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var port: Int = 8080</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private var _database: DatabaseConfig? = null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private var _logging: LoggingConfig? = null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun database(block: DatabaseConfig.() -> Unit) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _database = DatabaseConfig().apply(block)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun logging(block: LoggingConfig.() -> Unit) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _logging = LoggingConfig().apply(block)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun build(): String = \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Server: $host:$port</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Database: ${_database?.url ?: \"未配置\"}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Logging: ${_logging?.level ?: \"INFO\"}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"\"\".trimIndent()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@ConfigDsl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class DatabaseConfig {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var url: String = \"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var maxConnections: Int = 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@ConfigDsl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class LoggingConfig {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var level: String = \"INFO\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var file: String = \"app.log\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun server(block: ServerConfig.() -> Unit): String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return ServerConfig().apply(block).build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val config = server {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    host = \"0.0.0.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    port = 443</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    database {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        url = \"jdbc:postgresql://localhost:5432/mydb\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        maxConnections = 20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    logging {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        level = \"DEBUG\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        file = \"/var/log/server.log\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"中缀函数增强-dsl\">中缀函数增强 DSL</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class RouteBuilder {&#10;    private val routes = mutableListOf&lt;String&gt;()&#10;&#10;    infix fun String.to(handler: String) {&#10;        routes.add(&quot;$this -&gt; $handler&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fun build(): List&lt;String&gt; = routes&#10;}&#10;&#10;fun routes(block: RouteBuilder.() -&gt; Unit): List&lt;String&gt; {&#10;    return RouteBuilder().apply(block).build()&#10;}&#10;&#10;val appRoutes = routes {&#10;    &quot;/home&quot; to &quot;HomeController&quot;&#10;    &quot;/users&quot; to &quot;UserController&quot;&#10;    &quot;/api/data&quot; to &quot;DataController&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class RouteBuilder {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val routes = mutableListOf&#x3C;String>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    infix fun String.to(handler: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        routes.add(\"$this -> $handler\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun build(): List&#x3C;String> = routes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun routes(block: RouteBuilder.() -> Unit): List&#x3C;String> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return RouteBuilder().apply(block).build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val appRoutes = routes {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"/home\" to \"HomeController\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"/users\" to \"UserController\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"/api/data\" to \"DataController\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"gradle-kotlin-dsl\">Gradle Kotlin DSL</h2><p>Gradle 的 Kotlin DSL 是最广泛使用的 Kotlin DSL 实例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// build.gradle.kts&#10;plugins {&#10;    kotlin(&quot;jvm&quot;) version &quot;1.9.20&quot;&#10;    kotlin(&quot;plugin.serialization&quot;) version &quot;1.9.20&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;dependencies {&#10;    implementation(&quot;org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-coroutines-core:1.7.3&quot;)&#10;    testImplementation(kotlin(&quot;test&quot;))&#10;}&#10;&#10;tasks.test {&#10;    useJUnitPlatform()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// build.gradle.kts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>plugins {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    kotlin(\"jvm\") version \"1.9.20\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    kotlin(\"plugin.serialization\") version \"1.9.20\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dependencies {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    implementation(\"org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-coroutines-core:1.7.3\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    testImplementation(kotlin(\"test\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tasks.test {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    useJUnitPlatform()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Gradle DSL 背后的设计原则：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>Gradle 中的应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Lambda with Receiver</td>\n<td><code>dependencies { }</code>, <code>tasks { }</code> 等所有配置块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩展函数</td>\n<td><code>kotlin(&quot;jvm&quot;)</code>, <code>implementation()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运算符重载</td>\n<td><code>&quot;group:artifact:version&quot;</code> 字符串依赖解析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@DslMarker</code></td>\n<td>防止配置块之间的意外交叉引用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"dsl-设计最佳实践\">DSL 设计最佳实践</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>使用 <code>@DslMarker</code></strong>：防止嵌套 lambda 中的意外访问</li>\n<li><strong>保持 API 简洁</strong>：DSL 的价值在于可读性，避免暴露过多底层概念</li>\n<li><strong>提供合理默认值</strong>：减少必填配置项</li>\n<li><strong>配合 <code>apply</code> 模式</strong>：<code>Class().apply(block)</code> 是 DSL 的标准实现方式</li>\n<li><strong>使用中缀函数</strong>：增强键值对等二元关系的表达力</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[设计 Kotlin DSL] --&gt; B[定义领域模型类]&#10;    B --&gt; C[添加 @DslMarker 注解]&#10;    C --&gt; D[实现带接收者 lambda 的构建函数]&#10;    D --&gt; E[添加扩展函数和中缀函数增强可读性]&#10;    E --&gt; F[编写使用示例验证 API 人体工学]\">flowchart TD\n    A[设计 Kotlin DSL] --&gt; B[定义领域模型类]\n    B --&gt; C[添加 @DslMarker 注解]\n    C --&gt; D[实现带接收者 lambda 的构建函数]\n    D --&gt; E[添加扩展函数和中缀函数增强可读性]\n    E --&gt; F[编写使用示例验证 API 人体工学]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Lambda with Receiver</strong> 是 DSL 的核心，允许在 lambda 内直接访问接收者对象的成员</li>\n<li><strong>@DslMarker</strong> 限制嵌套 lambda 对外层接收者的隐式访问，是构建健壮 DSL 的必备工具</li>\n<li><strong>类型安全构建器</strong>结合 <code>apply</code> 模式和嵌套 lambda，实现声明式配置</li>\n<li><strong>中缀函数</strong>增强键值对和二元关系的可读性</li>\n<li>Gradle Kotlin DSL 是最成功的 Kotlin DSL 实例，展示了完整的设计范式</li>\n<li>好的 DSL 应简洁、有合理默认值，且在编译时即可发现错误</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"DSL 设计","id":"dsl-设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Lambda with Receiver","id":"lambda-with-receiver"},{"level":2,"text":"构建简单 DSL","id":"构建简单-dsl"},{"level":3,"text":"HTML 构建器","id":"html-构建器"},{"level":2,"text":"@DslMarker","id":"dslmarker"},{"level":2,"text":"Builder Pattern（类型安全构建器）","id":"builder-pattern-类型安全构建器"},{"level":2,"text":"中缀函数增强 DSL","id":"中缀函数增强-dsl"},{"level":2,"text":"Gradle Kotlin DSL","id":"gradle-kotlin-dsl"},{"level":2,"text":"DSL 设计最佳实践","id":"dsl-设计最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"序列","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/functional-patterns/sequences"},"next":{"title":"KMP 项目搭建","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/multiplatform/kmp-setup"}}